{"articleNo":"94098","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=94098&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[ACE사업]2013년 학생역량진단평가(K-CESA) 응시기간 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.10.29","hit":"4938","attachments":[{"name":"첨부 2. 2013년 K-CESA 안내 및 평가 수행 방법(직업능력개발원 제공).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94098&attachNo=73337"},{"name":"첨부 1. K-CESA 홍보자료 1부..pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=94098&attachNo=73344"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">2013년 학생역량진단평가(K-CESA) 응시기간 안내</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>-학부교육 선진화 선도대학 지원사업(ACE)-</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대학교육역량강화사업단에서는 재학생을 대상으로 실시하는 K-CESA(</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">K</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">orea </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">C</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ollegiate </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">E</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ssential </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">S</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">kills </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">A</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ssessment : 대학생 핵심역량 평가) 응시기간을 다음과 같이 알려드리니, 신청학생들은 해당 기간 내에 적극 참여하여 주시기 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▣ 응시기간 : 2013. 10. 30(수) ~ 11. 13(수)까지(기간 내 24시간 가능)</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><!--StartFragment--></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▣ 응시 대상자 : 응시 대상자는 개별적으로 인증번호가 문자 메시지로 전송</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 구 학부(과), 전공 소속 학생은 신설된 학부(과) 전공 소속으로 처리</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 1학년 학부생은 해당 신청 전공학생으로 처리</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 신청학생 중 연락처 오류 등으로 인하여 응시기간 문자메시지를 받지 못한 경우, </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">해당 학부(과) 또는 대학교육역량강화사업단으로 연락바람. </span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">▣ 응시방법 : </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">사이트 접속 후(www.kcesa.re.kr), 휴대폰으로 전송받은 개인별 인증번호</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">입력 후 시행.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT